## 🔀 Routing & Request Handling

### Route Decorators

```python
from flask import Flask

app = Flask(__name__)

# Simple route
@app.route('/hello')
def hello():
    return 'Hello'

# Dynamic routes with variables
@app.route('/user/<name>')
